## 5. REPORTING MECHANISMS

### 5.1 In-App Reporting

Every screen includes accessible reporting options:

**Letter Reporting:**
- "Report" button on every letter
- Specific reason selection (including "Child Safety Concern")
- Optional additional details

**User Reporting:**
- Report profile option on friend details
- Block user functionality
- Report specific messages within conversations

### 5.2 Reporting Flow

```
User Report → Automated Triage → Human Review → Action Taken
     ↓              ↓                  ↓              ↓
  Report    Priority scoring    Trained moderator    Warning/Suspension/
  received   (high for CSAE)      reviews within      Ban/Referral to
                                      24 hours          authorities
```

### 5.3 Anonymous Reporting
Users can report concerns without revealing their identity to the reported user.

