- **Tier 2 Specialists:** CSAE-trained moderators with psychological support
- **Legal Team:** Law enforcement liaison and compliance

### 7.2 Training Requirements
All moderators complete:
- Annual CSAE recognition training
- Trauma-informed review practices
- Legal reporting requirements training
- Cultural sensitivity and regional law awareness

### 7.3 Moderator Support
