## 8. DATA RETENTION AND PRIVACY

### 8.1 Evidence Preservation
When CSAE is detected:
- All relevant content preserved indefinitely for legal purposes
- User account data frozen (cannot be deleted by user)
- IP addresses and device information retained
- Timestamps and interaction logs preserved

### 8.2 User Privacy Protection
- Investigations conducted confidentially
- Reporting users' identities protected
- Compliance with data protection laws while prioritizing child safety

