## APPENDIX A: DEFINITIONS

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| **CSAM** | Child Sexual Abuse Material – Any visual depiction of sexually explicit conduct involving a minor |
| **CSAE** | Child Sexual Abuse and Exploitation – Broader term including grooming, sextortion, and trafficking |
| **Grooming** | Building an emotional connection with a minor to gain trust for sexual purposes |
| **Sextortion** | Threats to share intimate images to coerce victims into providing more content or other favors |
| **Hash Matching** | Comparing file hashes against known CSAM databases without viewing the actual content |

